      "widgets_values": [
        "## shorts bridge \u2014 Wan draft (5.00s)\n\nUS-safe 90s shorts: 18\u00d7120 frames @ 24 fps. This graph is ONE micro-shot.\nModels: wan2.2_ti2v_5B_fp16 + umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled (CLIP wan) + wan2.2_vae. Apache 2.0. Silent.\n1. Open the film bible (go-see-90s / still-here-90s / switchyard-90s) and copy shot N motion.\n2. Set LoadImage to example.png (smoke) or the previous ez_<film>_bN_sM_last PNG.\n3. Set VHS prefix to ez_<slug>_bN_sM_wan_video and last-frame SaveImage to ez_<slug>_bN_sM_last.\n4. Queue. Approve. Then Queue bridge-ltx with the SAME first frame for the print+audio.\n5. After 18 LTX prints: ./scripts/utilities/concat-shots.sh --film go-see --yes\nDo not Queue 90s in one graph. US-safe local pack only. No score.\nPrompt enhance: a Klein/Wan/LTX Prompt Enhance node sits upstream of CLIP. Leave Enhance off to use this canned prompt. Set Enhance true and XAI_API_KEY to rewrite a lazy sentence.\n"
